world has been falling apart for a long time.]"]},{"code":101,"params":["@silver_eyeclosed [This manner of decay...It's highly unprobable that the sun can fix it.]"]},{"code":101,"params":["@silver [You've already seen how bad it can get, right?]"]},{"code":101,"params":["@niko We...haven't seen much of anything, actually..."]},{"code":101,"params":["@niko_eyeclosed And we can't really just leave..."]},{"code":101,"params":["@silver2 [Oh, so you just got here?]"]},{"code":101,"params":["@silver [Then you must be headed towards the Tower.]"]},{"code":101,"params":["@niko M-hm!"]},{"code":101,"params":["@niko It's where I'm supposed put the lightbulb... er, sun, isn't it?"]},{"code":101,"params":["@silver [Yes, at the very top.]"]},{"code":101,"params":["@silver_lookup [We know that the Tower contains a force that nobody could comprehend.]"]},{"code":101,"params":["@silver_lookup [And the power is strongest at the summit.]"]},{"code":101,"params":["@silver [Maybe it will send you back home after you complete your mission.]"]},{"code":101,"params":["@niko_pancakes Oh!"]},{"code":101,"params":["@silver_eyeclosed [Don't take my word for it, though.]"]},{"code":122,"params":[49,49,0,0,0]}]},{"condition":{"switch1":177},"list":[{"code":122,"params":[49,49,0,0,2]}]},{"condition":{"var":49,"value":2},"list":[{"code":101,"params":["@niko Before I go...\\. Is there anything I can do in return?"]},{"code":101,"params":["@silver [Actually...]"]},{"code":101,"params":["@silver2 [Do you... \\.\\. know how to play chess?]"]},{"code":101,"params":["@niko_speak Yeah!\\n\\>\\@niko Well, sort of..."]},{"code":101,"params":["@niko_speak I've played it with some older kids before!"]},{"code":101,"params":["@silver [Then, will you play a game with me?]"]},{"code":101,"params":["@niko_eyeclosed I mean, I don't know the rules very well...."]},{"code":101,"params":["@niko_speak But I guess it's the least I could do!"]},{"code":231,"params":[1,"black",0,0,0,0,100,100,0,0]},{"code":232,"params