rams":["@silver [Knight.]"]},{"code":101,"params":["@niko_eyeclosed Right..."]},{"code":101,"params":["@niko_speak Oh! Have you ever been to any other regions?\\n\\>\\@niko I heard that there's two more."]},{"code":101,"params":["@silver [In the past, yes.]"]},{"code":101,"params":["@silver_eyeclosed [I still have the data, the coordinates,\\. the memories...]"]},{"code":101,"params":["@silver_eyeclosed [...I don't know how much of that still holds true.]"]},{"code":101,"params":["@silver [The world may be a very different place now.]"]},{"code":101,"params":["@niko Because the sun is gone?"]},{"code":101,"params":["@silver [No.]"]},{"code":101,"params":["@silver2 [I said this already, didn't I?]"]},{"code":101,"params":["@silver [The sun probably won't save the world.]"]},{"code":101,"params":["@silver_lookup [The decaying started back before the sun went out.]"]},{"code":101,"params":["@silver_eyeclosed [The sun's sudden death was just the tipping point, and things went south really fast after that.]"]},{"code":101,"params":["@niko Oh..."]},{"code":101,"params":["@niko_eyeclosed Then... there's nothing I can do?"]},{"code":101,"params":["@silver [Check.]"]},{"code":101,"params":["@niko_speak W-what!"]},{"code":101,"params":["@niko_eyeclosed When did your queen get there..."]},{"code":101,"params":["@silver [The only thing you can do is complete your pilgrimage.]"]},{"code":101,"params":["@silver_lookup [In a way, you are only supposed to be a second chance for the people.]"]},{"code":101,"params":["@silver [Just like how the Barrens was only supposed to be a second chance for me.]"]},{"code":101,"params":["@silver_eyeclosed [There's no guarantee that things will work out.]"]},{"code":101,"params":["@niko But..."]},{"code":101,"params":["@silver [Checkmate.]"]},{"code":101,"params":["@niko ..."]},{"code":101,"params":["@silver_eyeclosed [Alright, guess I've kept you long enough...]"]},{"code":101,"params":["@silver [...Thank you for listening.]"]},{"code":101,"para